WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.334
Hello, I'm Lizzie.

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.970
I'm a third year
studying Human Computer Interaction.

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:08.008
A fun tradition that I partake
in at CMU is painting the fence,

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:11.711
which is a lovely tradition that
I've wanted to do

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:14.314
since I did pre-college here
back in high school.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:19.853
It's amazing for building community and
meeting new people and sort of showcasing your work.

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:22.722
I've painted it for Game Creation Society,
Star Wars Day,

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:25.158
and transferring because
I am a transfer student.

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:29.462
It's one of those traditions that's kind
of hard to describe to people outside of CMU,

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:31.798
but it’s so much fun to partake in

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:34.968
and probably one of my favorite traditions
here on campus.